      "Language": "chi",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "Childhood asthma is the most common chronic airway inflammation disease. The phenotypes of childhood wheezing, early diagnosis of asthma and the difficulties in diagnosis, tailor-made treatment and monitoring are focus problems at present. Early diagnosis, tailor-made treatment and dynamic monitoring are key strategies of asthma control."},
